OL,3,ALindsay Clancy back in US court facing
OL,4,Apossible retrial for deaths of her
OL,5,Athree children
OL,6,
OL,7,FLindsay Clancy is back in court for a
OL,8,Fhearing that could decide whether she
OL,9,Fwill be retried for killing her three
OL,10,Fyoung children in 2023
OL,12,FThe Massachusetts woman's murder trial
OL,13,Ffell apart in September when a jury
OL,14,Fcould not unanimously decide on a
OL,15,Fverdict
OL,17,FLawyers on both sides are arguing about
OL,18,Fnext steps following the mistrial as
OL,19,Fthe defence argues the case should be
OL,20,Fdismissed entirely
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
