OL,3,ALindsay Clancy back in US court facing
OL,4,Apossible retrial for deaths of her
OL,5,Athree children
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge has indicated when he will
OL,8,Frule on dismissing the case
OL,10,FProsecutors are considering whether to
OL,11,Fseek a new trial - and they could put
OL,12,Fforward a date for that on Monday
OL,14,FThere have been tense moments as the
OL,15,Fdefence team questions how the judge
OL,16,Fhad handled the single holdout juror
OL,17,Fand the judge has threatened to stop
OL,18,Fthe hearing
